<title>ITALY: SOCCER-NAPOLI'S BETO HAS KNEE OPERATION.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-NAPOLI'S BETO HAS KNEE OPERATION.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-04-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Napoli's Brazilian midfielder Beto had keyhole surgery on his right knee at a Rome clinic on Saturday and will be out of soccer for a month, club sources said.</p>
<p>Beto joined Napoli this season from Botafago.</p>
<p>Club sources said he had been suffering from cartilage problems.</p>
